post {
  url: {{apiBaseUrl}}/auth/refresh
  body: none
}

docs {
  # Refresh session

  Refreshes the authenticated session using the `teamflow_refresh_token` cookie.
  Authentication: refresh session cookie; rate limited.
  Expected response: `200` with `authenticated: true` and refreshed cookies.
  Error case: `401` `INVALID_SESSION` when the refresh cookie is missing or expired.
}
